
                        Welcome to Ant Hills v1.0
                             by Ken Rastin


Installation
------------

I made Ant Hills as easy as possible to install.  Just do the following:

makedir pfiles:anthill
makedir pfiles:anthill/hills

You will find in the archive a file called 'hillsfiles.lha'.  Copy this file
to your pfiles:anthill directory and then unLHA it.  Put the file ANTHILLS!
in your pfiles directory and add it to be played as a C program file.

When someone has won the game, simply delete all the files in the 
pfiles:anthill/hills directory to reset the game.

